    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hey, cowboy! Pull out your revolver and shoot fast!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When night falls, monsters come swarming! Manage your gold wisely, fortify defenses, upgrade your weapons, and defend the town at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f40c48aff2d76393ba31ee7af3e3c50e.poster.avif?t=1744333038\" width=524 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f40c48aff2d76393ba31ee7af3e3c50e.webm?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f40c48aff2d76393ba31ee7af3e3c50e.mp4?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the Desert Express! Seize legendary treasures! Battle ferocious monstrosities and forge your legend amidst gunfire and sand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f58695a8ab471981f8f04d5940144eb1.poster.avif?t=1744333038\" width=524 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f58695a8ab471981f8f04d5940144eb1.webm?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f58695a8ab471981f8f04d5940144eb1.mp4?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u200b</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hey, cowboy! Pull out your revolver and shoot fast!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When night falls, monsters come swarming! Manage your gold wisely, fortify defenses, upgrade your weapons, and defend the town at all costs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f40c48aff2d76393ba31ee7af3e3c50e.poster.avif?t=1744333038\" width=524 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f40c48aff2d76393ba31ee7af3e3c50e.webm?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f40c48aff2d76393ba31ee7af3e3c50e.mp4?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the Desert Express! Seize legendary treasures! Battle ferocious monstrosities and forge your legend amidst gunfire and sand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f58695a8ab471981f8f04d5940144eb1.poster.avif?t=1744333038\" width=524 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f58695a8ab471981f8f04d5940144eb1.webm?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619380/extras/f58695a8ab471981f8f04d5940144eb1.mp4?t=1744333038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u200b</p>",
